---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import UniverseCard from "../components/UniverseCard.jsx";
import universes from "../data/universes.json";
---

<Layout
  title="The Multiverse Explorer — Road to Doomsday"
  description="Explore the known realities, alternate timelines, and branching dimensions converging toward Avengers: Doomsday and Secret Wars."
>
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Pure CSS Cosmic Nebula Ambient Layer -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 cosmic-radial-bg opacity-80" />
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 cosmic-stars-grid opacity-35" />

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24 space-y-20">
      <!-- ── Editorial Page Header ── -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent/15 border border-accent/30 text-accent-bright">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright animate-ping"></span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em]">
            MULTIVERSAL CARTOGRAPHY
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-wide title-glow">
          THE MULTIVERSE <span class="text-accent-bright">NEXUS</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
          With the fracturing of the Sacred Timeline in Phase 4 and the impending incursions of Phase 6, multiple cinematic continuities are colliding on the path to Avengers: Doomsday.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- ── Section 1: The Prime Timeline (Earth-616) ── -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-crimson shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(220,38,38,0.8)]"></span>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">
            Prime Timeline (Earth-616)
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-crimson/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-crimson/10 via-[#0c0e18] to-accent/10 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/[0.08] pb-4">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-crimson-bright font-bold">
                SACRED REALITY ANCHOR
              </span>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1">
                The Marvel Cinematic Universe (1943 – 2026)
              </h3>
            </div>
            <a href="/timeline" class="btn-primary text-xs self-start sm:self-auto">
              View Prime Timeline &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">
            The canonical continuum encompassing Phase 1 through Phase 6. From Tony Stark declaring "I am Iron Man" to the reality-shattering consequences of the Darkhold, the Quantum Realm, and Doctor Doom's convergence.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ── Section 2: Charted Realities & Legacy Universes ── -->
      <section class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/[0.06] pb-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(129,140,248,0.8)]"></span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">
              Charted Alternate Realities
            </h2>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted-dark">
            {universes.length} Identified Realities
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          {universes.map((uni) => (
            <UniverseCard universe={uni} client:load />
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ── Section 3: Incursions & Threat Briefing ── -->
      <section class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0b0e18]/90 backdrop-blur-xl">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-crimson-bright font-bold">
              THE MULTIVERSAL THREAT
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white">
              Incursions: When Realities Collide
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
              As first revealed in <em class="text-white">Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness</em> and expanded in <em class="text-white">Deadpool &amp; Wolverine</em>, multiversal travel causes instability. When two universes collide at their nexus points, neither survives unless balance is forged.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex justify-start lg:justify-end">
            <a href="/archive" class="btn-secondary text-xs">
              Consult Archive Records &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>